        "text": "Simplify $\\sqrt{50x^2y^3z}$, taking x and y to be positive.",
        "inline": []
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": "$5xy\\sqrt{2z}$"
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "$5\\sqrt{2xyz}$"
        },
